{"ts":"2026-07-24T23:59:58.211Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## What shipped and what did not\nThe attribution-enforcement work delivered strict unknown-author rejection, SDK test-all author parity, and a public acknowledgeUnknownAuthorHistoryEvents primitive with hardened error handling. Its acceptance criteria also stated that the five stranded events would be dispositioned and health would return ok:true. The primitive exists; the disposition was never executed against this repository, and there is no CLI or MCP path to execute it.\n\n## Why the disposition is a judgement call\nAcknowledgment records a reviewer, an attributed author, and a reason against immutable events. That is a maintainer decision about who is accountable for five specific historical mutations, not a mechanical cleanup, which is why it must be run deliberately rather than folded into a sweep.\n\n## Boundary\nNo history rewriting. No baseline movement. No hand-attribution of legacy pre-baseline events — only the five post-baseline actionable ones. Preventing future unknown-author events is the harness identity work, not this item."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-zqpnte"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Execute and expose the unknown-author acknowledgment flow: dispose the five stranded events and give the shipped SDK primitive a CLI and MCP surface"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":""},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Chore"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:cli","area:sdk","audit","author","governance","history","validate-warning"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-24T23:59:58.211Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-24T23:59:58.211Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":240},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"The five 2026-07-16 unknown-author test_run_track events carry an audited acknowledgment with reviewer, attributed author, and reason, recorded without rewriting history or moving the baseline; pm health returns ok:true and validate no longer reports validate_history_unknown_author_events for this workspace; acknowledgeUnknownAuthorHistoryEvents is reachable from the CLI and from MCP with the same typed errors as the SDK primitive, wired through every required registration site; Docs state when acknowledgment is appropriate and that it is a recorded disposition, never a way to attribute authorship after the fact"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"provable-history"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"Every validate and health warning maps to an open item, and the acknowledgment capability is reachable without writing SDK code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"The acknowledgment flow shipped as an SDK primitive and was never run against this repository, so pm health has reported ok:false continuously since 2026-07-16 and the workspace's own governance signal is permanently degraded."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"Restores health to a trustworthy binary signal instead of a known-red one that reviewers learn to ignore, and removes the last validate warning with no open owner."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/outcome","value":"The five stranded events carry an audited disposition, pm health returns ok:true, and acknowledgment is invocable from the CLI and MCP rather than only from TypeScript."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"The attribution-enforcement item closed on the strength of the primitive existing; the repo-side execution half was never scheduled, which is the same shipped-but-not-adopted pattern the merge-safety adoption work already hit once."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-33cw"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-5oj5","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:59:58.211Z"},{"id":"pm-e9zh","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:59:58.211Z"},{"id":"pm-h90s","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:59:58.211Z"},{"id":"pm-rtn5h6","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:59:58.211Z"},{"id":"pm-u14c","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:59:58.211Z"},{"id":"pm-usfg","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:59:58.211Z"},{"id":"pm-w7ccmv","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:59:58.211Z"},{"id":"pm-z9x1r2","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:59:58.211Z"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"8e7e57101c6afe7e3c5e8ccc24e88261c3199fcaab15fb46960e19c6fe372df3","message":"File repo-side execution and CLI exposure of the unknown-author acknowledgment flow"}
